		(property "Description" "JST SH 1.00 mm 4-way side-entry socket in STEMMA QT / Qwiic order: 1 GND (black), 2 3V3 (red), 3 SDA (blue), 4 SCL (yellow). NO PULL-UPS ON THE CARRIER - every Qwiic breakout brings its own, and GPIO3 is a strapping pin on the ESP32-S3. MP is the pair of board locks."
